                        Certified Behavioral Analyst
                    </span>
<span class="glass-panel px-4 py-2 text-label-caps font-label-caps text-primary uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full text-xs">
                        Master of Ceremonies
                    </span>
<span class="glass-panel px-4 py-2 text-label-caps font-label-caps text-primary uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full text-xs">
                        Corporate Strategist
                    </span>
<span class="glass-panel px-4 py-2 text-label-caps font-label-caps text-primary uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full text-xs">
                        Founder, The Daniel Generation
                    </span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right Column: Bio & Info -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-10 pt-4">
<!-- Headers -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<h2 class="text-label-caps font-label-caps text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">The Visionary at the Helm</h2>
<h1 class="font-display-lg md:font-display-xl text-display-lg md:text-display-xl text-on-surface leading-none">
                        Meet Stephen Kago
                    </h1>
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-2">
<div class="h-px bg-primary/40 w-12"></div>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-label-caps italic">Famously Known as "Generali"</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Biography -->
<div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none text-on-surface-variant font-body-lg flex flex-col gap-6">
<p class="leading-relaxed">
                        Stephen Kago, affectionately known across executive boards as "Generali", stands at the intersection of human behavioral dynamics and high-stakes corporate strategy. As the founder of The Daniel Generation, he has architected a framework for leadership that transcends traditional management, focusing on holistic dominion and strategic foresight.
                    </p>
<p class="leading-relaxed">
                        His specialized training in behavioral analysis allows him to decode organizational friction and deploy nuanced strategies that align human capital with overarching institutional goals. Generali's approach is not merely theoretical; it is a battle-tested methodology forged through years of advising top-tier executives, facilitating critical corporate negotiations, and commanding stages across the globe.
                    </p>
</div>
<!-- Quote Callout -->
<div class="glass-panel executive-corner p-8 mt-4 relative">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute -top-4 -left-4 text-primary text-4xl opacity-50 bg-background rounded-full p-2">format_quote</span>
<p class="font-headline-lg md:font-headline-lg text-primary italic leading-snug">
                        "The Daniel Mantle is one of the greatest strategies for dominion—combining light, understanding, and excellent wisdom to shape systems and culture."
                    </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Impact Counter Strip -->
<div class="mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-primary/20">
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 divide-x divide-transparent lg:divide-primary/20">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2 px-4 group">
<span class="font-display-lg text-primary group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors duration-300">15,000+</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Leaders Mentored</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2 px-4 group lg:border-l lg:border-primary/20">
<span class="font-display-lg text-primary group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors duration-300">500+</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Corporate &amp; Social Events</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2 px-4 group lg:border-l lg:border-primary/20">
<span class="font-display-lg text-primary group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors duration-300">50+</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Institutional Workshops</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-2 px-4 group lg:border-l lg:border-primary/20">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary mb-1 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">public</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Global Reach across Africa &amp; Beyond</span>
</div>
</div>
